                                ' finding 2026-10-04, live fa#1211). The agent:rework arm is WITHHELD' +
                                ' (empty-lap cap ' + emptyLaps + '/' + lapMax + ') and this head will' +
                                ' not be re-validated \u2014 the machine will not re-arm itself here.'
